newstroke_glyphs.txt: the glyphs of KiCad's newstroke font, one a line, line n for code point n + 32 (U+0020..U+FFEE), as
common/newstroke_font.cpp (KiCad 9.0 branch) holds them; extracted by the fork's docs/FORK-CF-ACCESS.md recipe, unchanged.

newstroke_font.cpp - definitions for automatically converted font
